\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces All four submitted configurations on the PlantCLEF 2026 hidden test set. The $\Delta $ shrinks monotonically as the priors become more information-theoretically orthogonal to the visual posterior --- a signature of i002 implicitly absorbing all three signals through training-distribution co-occurrence. \emph  {Stacks per row}: the i002 anchor is bare; both reranking and phenology pivots add Multi-Scale Retinex (MSR) preprocessing on top of the anchor; the cRT submission additionally integrates Frank-Wolfe sparse selection, PAV-Tree hierarchical calibration, and Conformal Prediction --- see the corresponding Pivot subsections for the explicit per-submission stacks.}}{11}{table.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:summary}{{1}{11}{All four submitted configurations on the PlantCLEF 2026 hidden test set. The $\Delta $ shrinks monotonically as the priors become more information-theoretically orthogonal to the visual posterior --- a signature of i002 implicitly absorbing all three signals through training-distribution co-occurrence. \emph {Stacks per row}: the i002 anchor is bare; both reranking and phenology pivots add Multi-Scale Retinex (MSR) preprocessing on top of the anchor; the cRT submission additionally integrates Frank-Wolfe sparse selection, PAV-Tree hierarchical calibration, and Conformal Prediction --- see the corresponding Pivot subsections for the explicit per-submission stacks}{table.caption.7}{}}
\newlabel{tab:summary@cref}{{[table][1][]1}{[1][11][]11}}
